---
description: Verify the active MediaApp checkout before editing or building
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read AGENTS.md's active checkout note before changes and after resuming.
- Run Tools/check-checkout.sh; stop and resolve the checkout if it fails.
- Check pwd, git status --short --branch, git worktree list, and recent commits.
- Use the user-confirmed checkout explicitly for every edit, build, test and install.
- If versions differ, compare them and preserve dirty work before reconciling.
- Do not copy older files wholesale over newer features or change persistence formats unintentionally.
- Recheck branch/commit before reporting results; name the checkout actually tested.
